  "observations": [
    "One registered attempt, with no replacement trials, model substitution or widened ceilings.",
    "Scripted native scoring consumed its 90-second finalization allowance. Score replay rejected its incomplete report with scorer scope population mismatch; control and schema aggregation were consequently unavailable in that phase.",
    "Every accepted original passed individual artifact replay during its trial; no late rescore or replay is counted toward the registered readiness gate.",
    "Both model runs passed native scoring, independent replay and schema checks, with the same schema digest. The all-run schema gate is false because the scripted finalization did not supply its schema check, not because a model schema mismatch was observed.",
    "Qwen had seven verified successes and one inconclusive retrieval task whose follow-up could not finish after a write, leaving required checks missing.",
    "Seven Llama tasks returned tool-shaped JSON as ordinary text without executing native calls. One used native tools but finished with required evidence missing. None verified successfully.",
    "Neither model attempted task_begin/task_revise, malformed native arguments or a multi-tool batch in this run. These fresh synthetic observations are not a matched causal comparison or learning-benefit evidence.",
    "The premature_prose_endings counter means a final prose response with an inconclusive native verdict, including a final report after task_finish returned inconclusive; it is not an inference about model intent.",
    "All originals remain private. Public evidence contains aggregates and hashes only.",
    "Native argument observations check JSON representation and schema field/type requirements. Operational errors such as invalid paths or criterion identifiers remain in the task evidence; zero malformed argument observations does not claim every proposed operation was correct."
  ],
